@startuml
!theme plain
title Card Authorization → Clearing → Settlement → Merchant Payout
autonumber
actor Shopper
participant "Merchant" as Merchant
participant "Gateway / Orchestrator" as Gateway
participant "Acquirer / Processor" as Acquirer
participant "Card Network" as Network
participant "Issuer" as Issuer
participant "Clearing Service" as Clearing
participant "Settlement Reports" as Reports
participant "Merchant Funding" as Funding
participant "Payout Bank" as Bank
participant "Reconciliation" as Recon

Shopper -> Merchant : purchase GBP 100.00 (synthetic)
Merchant -> Gateway : authorize (orderId, token, amount)
Gateway -> Acquirer : authorization request
Acquirer -> Network : forward authorization
Network -> Issuer : request authorization
Issuer --> Network : approval
Network --> Acquirer : authorization result
Acquirer --> Gateway : approved + reference
Gateway --> Merchant : AUTHORIZED (not settled)

... At capture time (merchant policy) ...
Merchant -> Gateway : capture authorization GBP 100.00
Gateway -> Clearing : create durable capture
Clearing -> Acquirer : submit presentment records
Acquirer -> Network : scheme financial presentment
Network -> Issuer : clearing / financial records
Acquirer --> Clearing : item/file status (per contract)

... Financial clearing and settlement cycle ...
Network -> Network : calculate participant obligations
Network --> Acquirer : clearing / settlement reports or positions
Acquirer --> Reports : processor reports and funding evidence
Reports -> Funding : eligible processor/acquirer funding
Funding -> Funding : gross - fees - adjustments - reserves
Funding -> Bank : merchant payout GBP 97.80 (example)
Bank --> Funding : bank payout status

... Independent reconciliation ...
Reports -> Recon : processor / settlement reports
Clearing -> Recon : captures and presentments
Funding -> Recon : payout reference and net amount
Bank -> Recon : bank statement
Recon -> Recon : compare identifiers, amounts and dates
Recon --> Merchant : reporting / exception status (where supported)

note over Network,Bank
Interbank scheme settlement and merchant payout are
distinct processes and may have different dates.
end note
@enduml